    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch your friends and annoy them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch Party</strong> is a fighting game with physics-based characters that you can play with a maximum of 4 people and strange natural phenomena occur during the fight. Customize your character, gather your motivation and dive into the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/01acaa6b32d2d2318b1952b4984c261d.poster.avif?t=1738606623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/01acaa6b32d2d2318b1952b4984c261d.webm?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/01acaa6b32d2d2318b1952b4984c261d.mp4?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness interesting natural phenomena while punching your friends! It varies depending on each map. You can interact with items on the ground and use them against your friends. Be careful, if you get hit in the head, you will be stunned and your opponent will have an opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/2ef0dbea39ea2323e52469c283bd287f.poster.avif?t=1738606623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/2ef0dbea39ea2323e52469c283bd287f.webm?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/2ef0dbea39ea2323e52469c283bd287f.mp4?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch your friends and annoy them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch Party</strong> is a fighting game with physics-based characters that you can play with a maximum of 4 people and strange natural phenomena occur during the fight. Customize your character, gather your motivation and dive into the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/01acaa6b32d2d2318b1952b4984c261d.poster.avif?t=1738606623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/01acaa6b32d2d2318b1952b4984c261d.webm?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/01acaa6b32d2d2318b1952b4984c261d.mp4?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness interesting natural phenomena while punching your friends! It varies depending on each map. You can interact with items on the ground and use them against your friends. Be careful, if you get hit in the head, you will be stunned and your opponent will have an opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/2ef0dbea39ea2323e52469c283bd287f.poster.avif?t=1738606623\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/2ef0dbea39ea2323e52469c283bd287f.webm?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347020/extras/2ef0dbea39ea2323e52469c283bd287f.mp4?t=1738606623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
